am ships without waiting for the billing team), independent scaling (scale the hot service, not everything), technology choice per service, and failure isolation — one service's memory leak pages one team instead of taking down the site. This last one is the real prize at scale.", "start": 95.125, "end": 116.9, "words": [{"text": "Microservices", "start": 95.425, "end": 96.312}, {"text": "strengths", "start": 96.312, "end": 97.175}, {"text": "independent", "start": 97.175, "end": 97.912}, {"text": "deployment", "start": 97.912, "end": 98.812}, {"text": "the", "start": 98.812, "end": 98.987}, {"text": "search", "start": 98.987, "end": 99.3}, {"text": "team", "start": 99.3, "end": 99.625}, {"text": "ships", "start": 99.625, "end": 99.912}, {"text": "without", "start": 99.912, "end": 100.25}, {"text": "waiting", "start": 100.25, "end": 100.6}, {"text": "for", "start": 100.6, "end": 100.713}, {"text": "the", "start": 100.713, "end": 100.8}, {"text": "billing", "start": 100.8, "end": 101.125}, {"text": "team", "start": 101.125, "end": 101.75}, {"text": "independent", "start": 101.75, "end": 102.525}, {"text": "scaling", "start": 102.525, "end": 103.213}, {"text": "scale", "start": 103.213, "end": 103.65}, {"text": "the", "start": 103.65, "end": 103.75}, {"text": "hot", "start": 103.75, "end": 104.013}, {"text": "service", "start": 104.013, "end": 104.725}, {"text": "not", "start": 104.725, "end": 105.1}, {"text": "everything", "start": 105.1, "end": 105.875}, {"text": "technology", "start": 105.875, "end": 106.662}, {"text": "choice", "start": 106.662, "end": 106.975}, {"text": "per", "start": 106.975, "end": 107.138}, {"text": "service", "start": 107.138, "end": 107.675}, {"text": "and", "start": 107.675, "end": 107.9}, {"text": "failure", "start": 107.9, "end": 108.375}, {"text": "isolation", "start": 108.375, "end": 109.362}, {"text": "one", "start": 109.362, "end": 109.737}, {"text": "service's", "start": 109.737, "end": 110.263}, {"text": "memory", "start": 110.263, "end": 110.7}, {"text": "leak", "start": 110.7, "end": 110.938}, {"text": "pages", "start": 110.938, "end": 111.412}, {"text": "one", "start": 111.412, "end": 111.65}, {"text": "team", "start": 111.65, "end": 112.037}, {"text": "instead", "start": 112.037, "end": 112.388}, {"text": "of", "start": 112.388, "end": 112.475}, {"text": "taking", "start": 112.475, "end": 112.825}, {"text": "down", "start": 112.825, "end": 113.013}, {"text": "the", "start": 113.013, "end": 113.112}, {"text": "site", "start": 113.112, "end": 113.875}, {"text": "This", "start": 113.875, "end": 114.275}, {"text": "last", "start": 114.275, "end": 114.612}, {"text": "one", "start": 114.612, "end": 114.825}, {"text": "is", "start": 114.825, "end": 114.975}, {"text": "the", "start": 114.975, "end": 115.088}, {"text": "real", "start": 115.088, "end": 115.375}, {"text": "prize", "start": 115.375, "end": 115.75}, {"text": "at", "start": 115.75, "end": 115.912}, {"text": "scale", "start": 115.912, "end": 116.65}]}, {"index": 8, "kind": "prose", "text": "Conway's law: the part nobody warns you about", "start": 116.9, "end": 120.125, "words": [{"text": "Conway's", "start": 117.175, "end": 117.65}, {"text": "law", "start": 117.65, "end": 118.05}, {"text": "the", "start": 118.05, "end": 118.3}, {"text": "part", "start": 118.3, "end": 118.575}, {"text": "nobody", "start": 118.575, "end": 118.925}, {"text": "warns", "start": 118.925, "end": 119.225}, {"text": "you", "start": 119.225, "end": 119.325}, {"text": "about", "start": 119.325, "end": 119.9}]}, {"index": 9, "kind": "prose", "text": "\"Organizations design systems that mirror their own communication structure.\" — Melvin Conway, 1968 (written 1967)", "start": 120.125, "end": 129.8, "words": [{"text": "Organizations", "start": 120.35, "end": 121.3}, {"text": "design", "start": 121.3, "end": 121.763}, {"text": "systems", "start": 121.763, "end": 122.3}, {"text": "that", "start": 122.3, "end": 122.513}, {"text": "mirror", "start": 122.513, "end": 122.85}, {"text": "their", "start": 122.85, "end": 123.062}, {"text": "own", "start": 123.062, "end": 123.35}, {"text": "communication", "start": 123.35, "end": 124.075}, {"text": "structure", "start": 124.075, "end": 125.025}, {"text": "Melvin", "start": 125.025, "end": 125.65}, {"text": "Conway", "start": 125.65, "end": 126.275}, {"text": "1968", "start": 126.275, "end": 127.775}, {"text": "written", "start": 127.775, "end": 128.125}, {"text": "1967", "start": 128.125, "end": 129.55}]}, {"index": 10, "kind": "prose", "text": "This is the closest thing our field has to a law of physics. Three teams that never talk will produce three services with awkward seams in exactly the places the teams don't talk. Microservices don't fix communication problems — they fossilize them into network boundaries. If your org chart is a mess, your service diagram will be a mess with latency.", "start": 129.8, "end": 152.2, "words": [{"text": "This", "start": 130.075, "end": 130.275}, {"text": "is", "start": 130.275, "end": 130.425}, {"text": "the", "start": 130.425, "end": 130.538}, {"text": "closest", "start": 130.538, "end": 131.025}, {"text": "thing", "start": 131.025, "end": 131.238}, {"text": "our", "start": 131.238, "end": 131.388}, {"text": "field", "start": 131.388, "end": 131.775}, {"text": "has", "start": 131.775, "end": 132.0}, {"text": "to", "start": 132.0, "end": 132.1}, {"text": "a", "start": 132.1, "end": 132.213}, {"text": "law", "start": 132.213, "end": 132.5}, {"text": "of", "start": 132.5, "end": 132.625}, {"text": "physics", "start": 132.625, "end": 133.525}, {"text": "Three", "start": 133.525, "end": 133.988}, {"text": "teams", "start": 133.988, "end": 134.45}, {"text": "that", "start": 134.45, "end": 134.613}, {"text": "never", "start": 134.613, "end": 134.913}, {"text": "talk", "start": 134.913, "end": 135.275}, {"text": "will", "start": 135.275, "end": 135.4}, {"text": "produce", "start": 135.4, "end": 135.788}, {"text": "three", "start": 135.788, "end": 136.088},