raction becomes a mechanical move, not an archaeology project. Shopify runs one of the world's largest Rails monoliths this way; Amazon Prime Video famously moved back from microservices to a monolith for one workload and cut infrastructure costs about 90 percent.", "start": 203.8, "end": 244.625, "words": [{"text": "Here's", "start": 204.075, "end": 204.338}, {"text": "the", "start": 204.338, "end": 204.45}, {"text": "option", "start": 204.45, "end": 204.838}, {"text": "the", "start": 204.838, "end": 204.925}, {"text": "discourse", "start": 204.925, "end": 205.375}, {"text": "skips", "start": 205.375, "end": 206.075}, {"text": "a", "start": 206.075, "end": 206.312}, {"text": "modular", "start": 206.312, "end": 206.8}, {"text": "monolith", "start": 206.8, "end": 207.375}, {"text": "one", "start": 207.375, "end": 207.675}, {"text": "deployable", "start": 207.675, "end": 208.475}, {"text": "but", "start": 208.475, "end": 208.688}, {"text": "with", "start": 208.688, "end": 208.863}, {"text": "strict", "start": 208.863, "end": 209.275}, {"text": "internal", "start": 209.275, "end": 209.725}, {"text": "module", "start": 209.725, "end": 210.05}, {"text": "boundaries", "start": 210.05, "end": 210.888}, {"text": "separate", "start": 210.888, "end": 211.275}, {"text": "packages", "start": 211.275, "end": 212.025}, {"text": "explicit", "start": 212.025, "end": 212.65}, {"text": "interfaces", "start": 212.65, "end": 213.525}, {"text": "no", "start": 213.525, "end": 213.9}, {"text": "sneaky", "start": 213.9, "end": 214.325}, {"text": "cross", "start": 214.325, "end": 215.75}, {"text": "imports", "start": 215.75, "end": 215.75}, {"text": "You", "start": 215.75, "end": 215.875}, {"text": "keep", "start": 215.875, "end": 216.062}, {"text": "the", "start": 216.062, "end": 216.15}, {"text": "monolith's", "start": 216.15, "end": 216.688}, {"text": "operational", "start": 216.688, "end": 217.35}, {"text": "simplicity", "start": 217.35, "end": 218.0}, {"text": "while", "start": 218.0, 